window.products.push({"id":80234,"name":"12 Inch Gas Cooktop, Cooksir 2 Burner Built-in Gas Stove Top Suitable for Dual Fuel LPG/NG, Glass Gas Stovetop with Pressure Regulator, Thermocouple P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r-5VmGT+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooksir is a company with a variety of kitchen cooktops, and has many years of experience in research and development, production, sales and service. Cooksir has a strong product development team and advanced production technology. The company's main products include gas cooktops, electric ceramic cooktops and induction cookers. In the future, our products will enter every family and bring you a high-quality experience. Cooksir 12 Inch Gas Cooktop, 2 Burner Built-in Gas Stove Top Suitable for Dual Fuel LPG/NG, 110v Glass Gas Hob with Pressure Regulator, Thermocouple Protection Gas Stove Top Specification Product Size：20.08''x 12.20''x 2.75''（51x31x7cm） Built-in Size：18.9''x 11.02''（48x28cm） Fuel Type：Propane / Natural Gas Burner Power：10236 + 5971BTU Electronic Ignition：110v Natural Gas or Propane Gas Cooktop The initial setting of the dual fuel gas stove is applicable to natural gas. If you want to use propane, the NG nozzle of the burner must be replaced with LPG nozzle, which can be replaced with a hexagon screwdriver in the accessory kit. We also gave a pressure regulator as a gift. You need to prepare a suitable fuel pipe to connect the fuel and pressure regulator. Safety Gas Stove The 2 burners glass gas furnace with flame failure device(FFD) adopts automatic thermocouple protection, which can automatically shut down to help avoid gas leakage accidents when no flame is detected. For your safety, all joints need to be leak tested with soapy water before use. If you see any bubbles or hear any gas leakage, please stop using it and contact us, or you can search for relevant videos on YouTube. Packing List 1 x Gas Cooktop 2 x LPG Nozzle 1 x Pressure Gegulator 1 x Hexagon Screwdriver 1 x Slotted Screwdriver 1 x Thread Seal Tape 4 x Screw 4 x Hook Up 1 x Instruction Booklet 1 x Sponge Strips","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r-5VmGT+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooksir","source_asin":"B0BL1NGPV2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL1NGPV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL1NGPV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
