window.products.push({"id":80269,"name":"Kitchenaid Dishwasher Rack Wheels WPW10195417 W10195417 Whirlpool Dishwasher Wheels Lower Rack Kenmore Roller Part KDTE104ESS1 KDTE104ESS2 KDTM354DSS4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614XNVmkD0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 W10195417 Dishwasher Wheel - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers WPW10195417, AP6016764, PS11750057, WPW10195417VP. Wpw10195417 Dishwasher Wheels Lower Rack are compatible with Whirlpool, Jenn-Air, Kenmore, KitchenAid. Whirlpool Wpw10195417 Wheels are designed to fit onto the vertical rack supports, allowing the rack to slide in and out of the dishwasher with ease. Our durable part is made of grey plastic. Rack wheels fit hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Part W10195417? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Kitchenaid W10195417 will help if there's a door latch failure or the door doesn't close. Kitchenaid Dishwasher Dishrack Roller Wpw10195417 fits onto the end of the rack supports and snap securely into place, providing a stable and secure platform for the upper dish rack. 💡 Kitchenaid Wpw10195417 Wheels are made from durable plastic materials and are built to withstand the harsh environment of a dishwasher. They are designed to resist wear and tear from exposure to high temperatures, water, and cleaning chemicals. The wheels feature a circular shape and are equipped with a small axle that allows them to rotate smoothly on the rack supports. Our wheels meet or exceed all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Can you replace wheels on a dishwasher rack? Yes, it is possible to replace the wheels on a dishwasher rack. Over time, the wheels on a dishwasher rack can become worn, damaged or broken, which can cause the rack to become difficult to slide in and out of the dishwasher. Fortunately, most dishwasher models have removable and replaceable wheels, so it is possible to replace them without having to replace the entire rack. 💡 How do I keep my dishwasher wheels from falling off? To prevent Kitchen Aid Wpw10195417 from falling off, regularly clean the wheels and rack supports. Check for damage and replace any damaged wheels in time. Properly align and securely attach new wheels with pliers or a screwdriver. Avoid overloading the dishwasher and slamming the door, which can cause excess weight and jostling that can loosen the wheels. By following these tips, you can keep the Wpl Wpw10195417 securely attached.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614XNVmkD0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B088TTJ7HZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TTJ7HZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TTJ7HZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
