window.products.push({"id":80343,"name":"W10814296 Washer Tub Seal For Whirlpool Kenmore AP5983753 PS11723081 KAWE860WWH0 KAWE679BBL1 LA5200XTW0 GSQ9669LG1 110.20904990 110.82980120 LSQ8243HQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HNQWuYR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Tub Seal W10814296 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5983753, 383727, 21050, 62665, 96690, J27-362, LP633, PS11723081, W10814296VP. Center Post Gasket W10814296 is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Estate, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Maytag, Roper. It is made of durable rubber material that is resistant to water and chemical exposure. It is designed to withstand the high-speed rotations and vibrations of the washer without compromising its sealing properties. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Kenmore W10814296 Tub Seal will help if your appliance is leaking. Proper installation of the Whirlpool W10814296 is crucial for optimal performance of your appliance. Wear work gloves to protect your hands during the replacement process. Disassembling the washing machine is required. 💡 Centerpost Gasket W10814296 plays a vital role in maintaining a watertight seal between the centerpost and tub of a dishwasher. Its primary function is to prevent water from leaking out of the dishwasher tub while the wash cycle is in progress. Additionally, it contributes to a quieter operation by minimizing vibrations and reducing noise levels within the dishwasher. Tub Seal meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime return policy and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 What is the expected lifespan of the washer tub seal? The expected lifespan of the W10814296 Tub Seal can vary depending on several factors, including usage patterns, maintenance, and the overall condition of the washing machine. However, on average, a properly installed and well-maintained tub seal can last several years. Regular inspections and prompt replacement of a worn or damaged tub seal can also help prevent any potential leaks and ensure optimal performance of your washing machine. 💡 Can I repair the tub seal instead of replacing it? The tub seal is not designed to be repaired. If the seal becomes worn, damaged, or faulty, it is recommended to replace it rather than attempting to repair it. Repairing the tub seal may not provide a reliable and long-lasting solution, as the seal's integrity and effectiveness could still be compromised. Replacing the seal with a new one is the best course of action to ensure proper sealing and prevent water leakage in your washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HNQWuYR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B0892PWHLW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892PWHLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892PWHLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
