window.products.push({"id":80518,"name":"Freezimer Ice Makers Countertop, 33Lbs/24 Hours, Portable Ice Maker Machine Countertop, 9 Cubes Ready in 7-10 Mins, 2 Size Ice Cubes, Self-Cleaning Ic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eIbhw0AGL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【33 Lbs Ice Daily Production】Freezimer countertop ice maker with 33 pounds of ice per day for your daily needs. Ice basket can store as much as 3.3 pounds/120 pcs of ice at a time. If a cup of coffee needs 5-10 ice cubes, ice maker machine with 2.8L water tank can satisfy 185-370 cups a day. 【2 Size Ice Cubes Selectable】Popular bullet-shaped ice cubes produced by Freezimer portable ice maker are not easy to melt or stick, and two different sizes of ice cubes (S/L) available to be selected. Great for barbecue, basement bars, coffee shop, home party, etc. 【9 Ice Cubes Ready in 7-10 Minutes】The ice machine maker countertop adopt powerful compressor with thicker pew uew, 26g R600a refrigerant makes refrigeration system stable and efficient, just 7-10 minutes to get 9 pcs bullet-shaped ice cubes. Enjoy fresh chilled wine, whisky, beer, juice, soda all day long! 【Automatic Cleaning Function】Ice makers countertop with self-cleaning function that greatly facilitates your daily maintenance work. You only need to add water to the reservoir and select \"Clean\" mode to start the auto cleaning function. After cleaning, the drain plug at the bottom of ice machine can be removed to drain the water. 【Infrared Induction Technology】The compact small ice maker adopts advanced infrared sensor technology, whether it’s running out of water or the ice basket reaching its max capacity, it will stop working and the indicator light will light red. A perfect Christmas gift for your family and friends who like chilled beer or beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eIbhw0AGL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freezimer","source_asin":"B0C3C5P3DB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3C5P3DB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3C5P3DB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
