window.products.push({"id":80763,"name":"Trifecte 30 Inch Gas Cooktop with 5 SABAF Burners, Stainless Steel Gas Stove Top with Timer LPG/NG Convertible Dual Fuel Propane Cooktop Gas Hob-Easy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":238.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h64d8QFnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【LPG/NG Convertible & Timer】Our dual fuel gas stovetop is designed for natural gas and liquid propane. The initial setting is for natural gas, come with a LPG gas conversion kit; This gas hob has a Timer to REMIND you that your cooking is over, when you hear a sound of \"Ding\", you must stop your work on hand to continue your cooking. The time for the alarm timer is 0-60 minutes, you can set it according to cooking needs. ✔【5 Italy Sabaf Burners】This gas cooktop 30 inch provides 5 different Sabaf burners, which are powerful and high efficiency. Two fast 10000 BTU burners, Two 6000 BTU burners, and an auxiliary 3500 BTU burner. They will distribute even heat for simmer, boil, stir-frying, steaming, melting or others, which is very suitable for family daily use. ✔【Thermocouple Protection】This 30 inch gas stove top with flame failure device uses an automatic Spanish Orkeli Thermocouple Protection safety device, which ensures the gas is automatically cut off to help avoid gas leakage form the gas cooktop when no flame is detected. UL certified power cable, plug, and internal connection cables. ✔【Unique Design & Easy to Clean】Heavy duty cast iron grates make your stove burner more stable, the printing on the stainless steel surface is not easy to fade, and can be used for a long time; Our 30\" gas cooktop with durable zinc alloy knobs, it is not easy to melt at high temperature, and the 5 sealed burners can prevent spills from overflowing, which is easy to clean. ✔【Easy to Install】30 inch gas burner size: 30 L×20 W×4 H inches (Without stove foot), Cutout dimensions: 28-6/8 L×19-1/8 W inches. This stainless steel built-in gas stove can be installed easily. With 110-127V AC pulse Ignition system, the gas cooktop requires no battery. 59 inches long power cable, automatic ignition via rotating control, flexible and accurate gas adjustment. ✔【1-Year Quality Warranty】We provide a 12-month warranty for the stainless steel gas cooktop , replace a new set directly once it has any quality problems. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to solve for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h64d8QFnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRIFECTÉ","source_asin":"B09QSNLKZY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QSNLKZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QSNLKZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":80764,"name":"Countertop Dishwasher, GASLAND Chef Portable Dishwashers with 5 Washing Programs, 6 Place Setting Countertop or Built-in Dishwasher Machine, High-temp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ulu7dQbVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🎁【High-Temperature Clean & Air-Dry Mode 】 The counter dishwasher heats up the water to 160℉ for effectively remove oil stains. After washing, it will automatically dry the utensils inside with hot air drying, keeping your dishes dry and odorless, achieving a to sterilizing effect. 🎁【Ultra Compact Design】GASLAND Chef compact countertop dishwasher measures 21.65 x 19.69 x 17.72 inches, which comes with large interior capacity of the 6 place settings, ideal for families of 3-4 people. The ideal choice for small houses, dorms, apartments, boats and campers/RVS. 🎁【Multi Washing Programs】The automatic dishwasher comes with 5 washing programs-ECO, Normal, Intensive, Rapid and Glass. Additionally, lower spray arms help you powerful clean up every angle on each pot and pans, don't leave any water stains. 🎁【6 Place Setting & 2 Installation Modes】The compact dishwasher comes with large interior capacity of the 6 place settings, ideal for families of 3-4 people. The small machine is available for countertop and built-in installation, space-saving design and measures just 21.65 x 19.69 x 17.72 inches, It is good choice for small apartment, office and home kitchen. 🎁【Easy To Use】The dishwasher machine is basically ready to use out of the box. The LED display offers a user-friendly experience, 5 cleaning mode of the counter top dishwash can be easily monitored and adjusted at the electronic LED screen. 🎁【Excellent Customer Service】Backed by an Amazon Basics 1-year limited warranty. If you have any question, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ulu7dQbVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GASLAND","source_asin":"B093H62RF6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093H62RF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B093H62RF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":80765,"name":"Coffee Filter Holder, Coffee Filter Storage Container Farmhouse Coffee Filter Basket for Counter, Bamboo Coffee Filter Case for Coffee Bar Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Y8gNk3CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♨️High quality material : Our coffee filter holders are made of high-quality natural bamboo wood, environmentally friendly, durable and not easily deformed. The surface is coated with a safe varnish and can be wiped off with a clean paper towel. The coffee filter case holder has a wooden lid at the top, which enables the round storage container to keep your filter away from dust and moisture, prolong the service time of the filters. ♨️Charming farmhouse style : The surface of the coffee filter storage basket adopts the original color of bamboo with black font printing, which is full of charming style. This hides the unsightly coffee filters and takes up very little space, and is the perfect decoration for your coffee station. This will be look amazing in your counter, and makes displaying coffee filters basket fun. ♨️Convenient to use : We have added a metal handle to the wooden cover, so you can easily open and close the box. The round can be placed anywhere near the coffee machine, on the counter or on a shelf, it is easier to reach than a wall-mounted coffee filter holder and saves you brewing time! Except filters, you can also store other small items in the rustic container with lid, like coffee beans, sugar. ♨️Extensive applications : The coffee filter storage measures 7\" in diameter x 4.4\" high. This size is perfect for most common size filters, such as cone filters, square filters, round filters and flat bottom filters. There is enough capacity to store daily filter paper. Keep the kitchen and coffee station clean and tidy. ♨️100% Satisfaction guarantee : We have always been aiming at providing the best coffee filter holder, coffee bar decor, coffee bar accessories for you. We are confident that you’ll like our coffee filter storage since we have put our love into it. Any issues, please feel free to contact us, and we will provide the best service to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Y8gNk3CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruthynow","source_asin":"B09WVFPPY9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WVFPPY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WVFPPY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
