window.products.push({"id":80791,"name":"BOSALY Ice Maker Machine, 26lbs 24h Ice Cube Maker, Electric Ice Maker Portable with Ice Scoop and Basket, Perfect for Home/Kitchen/Office/Bar, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V5G2QOvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPACT DESIGN, WIDE APPLICATIONS: BOSALY Countertop ice maker has a stylish and chic design. It is perfect for home, office, RV, car camping, hunting cabins, bars and more. It can produce 2 size bullet-shaped ice cubes that is chewable & crystal delicious. Ideal for cooling different types of beverages, emergency ice, fresh the fruits, and much more than imagine. GET ICE CUBES IN 8-10MINS PER CYCLE: BOSALY small ice making machine produce up to 9 pcs of ice cubes in 8-10 mins and up to 26lb in 24h. It produces small size ice cube or large size cube that you can select depend on your preference. Transparent window lid on the top allows you to see clearly the ice making, no need to open the lid. No plumbing required, easy to fill and clean. INTELLIGENT ICE MAKER, EASY OPERATION: BOSALY ice maker with a simple control panel. Adding water, press on/off button, and select the size. It also features with a smart indicator that it will light up when the ice is full or you need to add more water. There is a drain plug at the bottom, no pipe design, easy to fill and clean. All for your convenience! LOW NOISE & ENERGY SAVING ICE MAKER: BOSALY ice making machine features with low noise level, fast cooling effect and low consumption. With a powerful compressor and 22g R600a refrigerant, no worry the noise annoying your family or your friends. Say “Goodbye to the old, noisy and bulky ice maker machines” Choose BOSALY ice maker, Enjoy an ice cold refreshing drinks. ALL FOR YOUR CONVINENCE: BOSALY always take customer satisfaction as our top priority. You will get a brand new ice maker machine with a removable basket and scoop. The first time using might be not so effective for it takes time to preheat like a freezer, but all thing will go well soon. Contact us directly if you need any assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V5G2QOvZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSALY","source_asin":"B088LYGYS5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LYGYS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LYGYS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
