window.products.push({"id":80900,"name":"Dc47-00016a Thermal Fuse Samsung Dryer Model Dv218aew/xaa Dv40j3000ew/a2 Dv42h5200ep/a3 Dv42h5200ew/a3 Dv45h7000ew/a2 Dv210aew/xaa Dv219aew/xaa Dv220a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mO51-A5pS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4201894, 2068545, PS4205213. Dryer fuse assembly is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore appliances. Dc47-00016a Thermal Fuse Samsung Part is located on the dryer's blower housing and is a small, rectangular device with two wires attached to it. Disconnect dryer from the power source before the repair. Dc47-00016a Thermal Fuse fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse will help if there's no heat or not enough heat, it doesn't start, or shuts off too soon. It is important to ensure that the replacement fuse has the same rating as the original, as using one with a different rating can result in further damage to the dryer. 💡 The Dc47-00016a Thermal Fuse is a safety device used in Samsung dryers to prevent the dryer from overheating and potentially causing a fire. The DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse is It is typically made of metal and has a thin wire inside that will melt if the temperature exceeds a safe level, breaking the circuit and shutting off the dryer's heating element. Our dryer thermal fuse meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are all dryer thermal fuses the same? No, not all dryer thermal fuses are the same. Different dryer models and brands may require specific thermal fuses that are designed to meet the specifications and requirements of that particular dryer. Each thermal fuse is rated for a specific temperature and current capacity. Using a wrong-rated thermal fuse can cause improper shut off of the dryer's heating element or early shut off, resulting in improper functioning of the dryer. 💡 Popular Models: dv209aew/xaa, dv210aew/xaa, dv218aeb-xaa, dv218aew/xaa, dv219aew/xaa, dv220aew/xaa, dv306lew/xaa, dv328aew/xaa, dv330aew/xaa, dv331aew-xaa, dv350aew-xaa, dv365etbgwr/a3, dv395etpasu/a1, dv400ewhdwr/aa, dv40j3000ew/a2, dv419aew/xaa, dv42h5000ew/a3, dv42h5200ef/a3, dv42h5200ep/a3, dv42h5200ew/a3, dv42h5400ef/a3, dv431aepxaa, dv448aep/xaa, dv45h7000ew/a2, dv48h7400ew/a2, dv48j7700ew/a2, dv50f9a7evp/a2, dv50f9a7evw/a2, dv5471aep/xaa, dv56h9000ep/a2, dve50m7450w/a3.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mO51-A5pS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07NP8MQKX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-80900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NP8MQKX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NP8MQKX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
